{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/6bfd9cc305775a38809a0435cd0fac10.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=72 /></span>A Novitiate Sister, Lumina, spends her days in peace at the church of Saint Linnea's boarding house. However, one day, her best friend Rina is kidnapped by a mysterious organization. In order to save her, Lumina will have to use the skill book passed down from her grandmother, but the price will be most dire... Meanwhile, there are strange occurrences surrounding the popular yet suspicious new religion, Neo-Lidom, that may pose a threat to both the town and Lumina herself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/e5f65c1c4668153983dcfca342a65e71.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span>There's no need to worry about leveling or grinding or tedious combat! In fact, there's none of it at all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the tale of Sister Lumina without any of the hassle in this story-focused RPG! Follow Lumina as she traverses the dangers of the cult to rescue Rina! But many mysteries lurk in the shadows... Will Lumina survive this ordeal unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/87f136bc65d06846be915ef9f8284d28.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/1a3e00e113c918a1c4d414f9eec8c4cb.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/1bba70debbb7070b21d15f46d5487a74.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span><strong>Situation Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From prayer to confessional booths, there are many different situations and scenes to enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147220?t=1749385135","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147220?t=1749385135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/9a041a00eddde0643c47edc56b4dd45d56368628/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749385135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/9a041a00eddde0643c47edc56b4dd45d56368628/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749385135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/6bfd9cc305775a38809a0435cd0fac10.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=72 /></span>A Novitiate Sister, Lumina, spends her days in peace at the church of Saint Linnea's boarding house. However, one day, her best friend Rina is kidnapped by a mysterious organization. In order to save her, Lumina will have to use the skill book passed down from her grandmother, but the price will be most dire... Meanwhile, there are strange occurrences surrounding the popular yet suspicious new religion, Neo-Lidom, that may pose a threat to both the town and Lumina herself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/e5f65c1c4668153983dcfca342a65e71.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span>There's no need to worry about leveling or grinding or tedious combat! In fact, there's none of it at all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the tale of Sister Lumina without any of the hassle in this story-focused RPG! Follow Lumina as she traverses the dangers of the cult to rescue Rina! But many mysteries lurk in the shadows... Will Lumina survive this ordeal unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/87f136bc65d06846be915ef9f8284d28.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/1a3e00e113c918a1c4d414f9eec8c4cb.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/extras/1bba70debbb7070b21d15f46d5487a74.avif?t=1749385135\" width=616 height=73 /></span><strong>Situation Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From prayer to confessional booths, there are many different situations and scenes to enjoy!</p>","developers":["StudioNAZE"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147220/header.jpg?t=1749385135","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura Games and StudioNaze, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147220/755017/1f71303b0177284a818ebcc487c93d6f91993bff/1750874999/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727927011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147220/755017/1f71303